For Daily Healthcheck 
cd /var/www/vendorpulse

# 1) Queue + workers healthy?
php artisan horizon:status && php artisan queue:failed

# 2) Latest email automation activity (last 10 email logs with automation metadata)
php artisan tinker --execute="dump(App\Models\EmailLog::query()->whereNotNull('processing_meta')->latest('created_at')->limit(10)->get(['id','organization_id','subject','processing_status','processing_meta','created_at'])->toArray());"

# 3) Latest invoices updated recently (check auto updates and paid timestamps)
php artisan tinker --execute="dump(App\Models\Invoice::query()->latest('updated_at')->limit(10)->get(['id','organization_id','vendor_id','number','status','currency','amount_cents','paid_at','updated_at'])->toArray());"

What to look for:

horizon:status should be running.
queue:failed should be empty or stable (not growing).
In email logs, processing_meta should include invoice_automation keys (created or updated).
In invoices, paid updates should have status=paid with paid_at set.

For Daily Healthcheck End


